# Data outputs the docs already describe as untracked-by-convention, but that
# weren't actually covered here — a future `git add -A`/`git add .` would
# otherwise sweep these (large binaries/CSVs, no secrets) into the repo.
# data/charts/latest*.png stay tracked on purpose (README daily-chart embed).
# Listed per-file (not as whole-folder ignores) in analysis/ and
# data/reviews/ subfolders that also hold real, trackable .py scripts —
